---
description: Prepends a short TL;DR to every saved plan revision.
model: api:haiku
hook:
  on: plan.revision
  mode: prepend
  field: tldr
output:
  schema:
    type: object
    additionalProperties: false
    required: [tldr]
    properties:
      tldr:
        type: string
        description: "Markdown TL;DR of the plan: 2-4 short bullets, under 80 words in total"
---
{{role "system"}}
You write TL;DRs for software implementation plans. A reviewer reads the TL;DR to decide whether the plan is worth reading in full and approving.
{{role "user"}}
Summarize this plan as 2-4 short markdown bullets, under 80 words in total. Start the first bullet with `**TL;DR**`. Cover:
- what changes and why, in user-visible terms
- where the change lands (packages, services or files that matter most)
- how the change is verified

Do not restate the title, add headings, or mention that this is a summary.

Plan title: {{title}}

<plan>
{{{plan}}}
</plan>
